<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:modeler="http://camunda.org/schema/modeler/1.0" xmlns:camunda="http://camunda.org/schema/1.0/bpmn" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Definitions_masterRuleDataList" targetNamespace="http://bpmn.io/schema/bpmn" exporter="bpmn-tool" exporterVersion="1.2.0" modeler:executionPlatform="Camunda Platform" modeler:executionPlatformVersion="7.15.0">
  <bpmn:process id="masterRuleDataList" name="업무기준 상세조회" isExecutable="true">
    <bpmn:documentation>masterRuleDataList — As-Is mui cmb/MasterRuleDataList (분석 §1 / §8) 의 To-Be BPMN.

★ 형제 masterRuleData 의 조회 전용(read-only) 서브셋 — 동적 테이블(TB_MCA_&lt;업무기준ID&gt;, DDL on-demand — Q-001b)/동적 컬럼 화면이나 저장·채번·긴급적용·orphan SQL 이 전부 없다 (분석 §0).
고유 기능: 마스터코드 셀(CODE_YN='Y') 클릭 → P-002(cma::masterCodeSelPop) 호출 (BR-008 — 클라이언트 only).

사용자 결정 (2026-06-04~05):
  - Q-007 동적 SQL 안전화 — 테이블명 서버 재조립(pRuleId 형식검증) + 조건컬럼 컬럼정의 화이트리스트(COL_ID 식별자 강제 포함) + 연산자 화이트리스트 + 값 파라미터 바인딩
  - Q-009 As-Is Java 변수명 혼동(pTable=context.get("pRuleId")) → To-Be 의미대로 정정

3 action 매핑 (As-Is UserTask 1종 흡수 — save 없음):
  action=search       → searchTask (masterRuleDataListService.search) — CTE+ROW_NUMBER 페이징 + 5조건 동적 WHERE + VARCHAR2 UPPER(BR-007), 응답 { ds_GetMasterRuleDataList, cnt, totalCount }
  action=lov          → lovTask (masterRuleDataListService.lov) — 컬럼정의+PK판정+CODE_YN (searchRuleColDefsWithPk 재사용 — 형제 동일 SQL), 응답 { ds_GetRuleColList, cnt }
  action=searchExport → exportTask (masterRuleDataListService.searchExport) — 전건 ORDER BY RULE_SEQ, 응답 { ds_GetMasterRuleDataListExport, cnt }</bpmn:documentation>
    <bpmn:extensionElements>
      <camunda:properties>
        <camunda:property name="input" value="action" />
      </camunda:properties>
    </bpmn:extensionElements>
    <bpmn:startEvent id="start">
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_to_gw</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:startEvent>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="actionGateway">
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <camunda:properties>
          <camunda:property name="input" value="action" />
        </camunda:properties>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_to_gw</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_search</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_lov</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_export</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="searchTask" name="Main 조회 (동적 테이블 페이징)" camunda:class="masterRuleDataListService">
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <camunda:properties>
          <camunda:property name="method" value="search" />
          <camunda:property name="output" value="result" />
          <camunda:property name="dto" value="com.dongkuk.dmes.mcm.cmb.masterRuleDataList.dto.MasterRuleDataListSearchRequest" />
        </camunda:properties>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_search</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_search_end</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="endSearch">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_search_end</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="lovTask" name="lov목록 조회 (컬럼정의+CODE_YN)" camunda:class="masterRuleDataListService">
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <camunda:properties>
          <camunda:property name="method" value="lov" />
          <camunda:property name="output" value="result" />
          <camunda:property name="dto" value="com.dongkuk.dmes.mcm.cmb.masterRuleDataList.dto.MasterRuleDataListSearchRequest" />
        </camunda:properties>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_lov</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_lov_end</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="endLov">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_lov_end</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="exportTask" name="Main 조회 엑셀 Export (전건)" camunda:class="masterRuleDataListService">
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <camunda:properties>
          <camunda:property name="method" value="searchExport" />
          <camunda:property name="output" value="result" />
          <camunda:property name="dto" value="com.dongkuk.dmes.mcm.cmb.masterRuleDataList.dto.MasterRuleDataListSearchRequest" />
        </camunda:properties>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_export</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_export_end</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="endExport">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_export_end</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_to_gw" sourceRef="start" targetRef="actionGateway" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_search" name="search" sourceRef="actionGateway" targetRef="searchTask" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_search_end" sourceRef="searchTask" targetRef="endSearch" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_lov" name="lov" sourceRef="actionGateway" targetRef="lovTask" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_lov_end" sourceRef="lovTask" targetRef="endLov" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_export" name="searchExport" sourceRef="actionGateway" targetRef="exportTask" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_export_end" sourceRef="exportTask" targetRef="endExport" />
  </bpmn:process>
